{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Test_Errors\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Test Errors</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> lies above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> to form the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> to form the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/91275aa1f85be8f39ea3ae3cef68f10100fc664b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lines on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/204a6f5a6757f5da4c1b3035ad8d806769744e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DB$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> and point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/b/4bbe91133fdaa92f3e58b137fdb4db178296da61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EB$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. Line segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/3951902c11a1cd39a091ea15f0f06cbc79095de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> is constructed. Specific angles are labelled as follows: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef9d38b51b093b9f644b5c9ef539d3cd4396dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAB = p^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8bcb2bf21466d57bde3586d2458f69531e022c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB = q^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858343a973d171a75747458e5ef6dc2e073ba44f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BFG = r^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69276c30a5ded3b13633d92de19be548e2d2e165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BGF = s^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/8/c08d13248094a13852708db16a27cb47c47e1947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BEC = t^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3de3ab75f6bff05b5a41041c37952ea18e45cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BCE = u^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/2/9328a7cf48f17c1914ffdf8bc7d8e9bc01505dac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r + s + t + u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the measures of the interior angles of any triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21ceb13147ab3db464516aab14f7150fe29309ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABD = 180^{\\circ} - (p^{\\circ} + q^{\\circ})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"225\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/5467c4aa5285b3030a0fd8d0739e94f95f2a0191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CBE = 180^{\\circ} - (t^{\\circ} + u^{\\circ})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"224\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/1479a2abb493eef5512131331575b5d403d77a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle FBG = 180^{\\circ} - (r^{\\circ} + s^{\\circ})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"224\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>However, we also see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808e73c19a61d229add21ce003513657a0b7f45c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/e/afe53e4f38fa294a786638962d79c7a2b8a8b43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CBE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a68aac848b618a3593b2e7243179913112ff62e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle AFBG$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" /> all form a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Straight_angle\" title=\"Straight angle\">straight angle</a>. This means we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588b339b2ff7d8c91954217d97b1fe321a5300d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ} - (p^{\\circ} + q^{\\circ}) + 180^{\\circ} - (t^{\\circ} + u^{\\circ}) + 180^{\\circ} - (r^{\\circ} + s^{\\circ}) = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"484\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/1/ae1710e7ad4114b5a26e8d5c9d9b2b669ae3549d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$540^{\\circ} - (p^{\\circ} + q^{\\circ} + t^{\\circ} + u^{\\circ} + r^{\\circ} + s^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"334\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264ec637b6cd40f1a2bee597c1e89d8d93e27342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$540 - 180 = p + q + r + s + t + u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"266\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d856a75bd4c122246179275b23bb2cf02525f7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q + r + s + t + u = \\boxed{360}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"228\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Test_Errors\">Test Errors</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Test Errors\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem says triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/1/8810a26f59e2c67b5f2ff052a7e2a294fef0a03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADB$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6adfd3ad27a2dddeb0af7131d73c33c86991e93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001945\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 196/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 491/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6698/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.984      1 -total\n 38.09%    6.469      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n 31.58%    5.364      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35969:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001945 and revision id 279536. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}